cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this formalization, please cite the versioned software release."
title: "Genuine Zero Uniform Atlas Energy"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Massensini
    given-names: Thiago
license: MIT
version: 0.12.0
date-released: 2026-08-17
abstract: >-
  A Lean 4 formalization of the native real-camera/Genuine zero identity, the
  faithful C2--C7 cutoff operator, sharp critical cutoff-tail and raw-energy
  asymptotics, exact logarithmic cutoff jets, and the concrete pointwise
  finite-to-infinite energy bridge. Version 0.12.0 adds an audited final
  confinement-frontier probe and a lateral canonical readout comparison while
  preserving the Genuine-first/native-first proof architecture: carry geometry,
  quadratic amplitude, all-camera invariance, exact cutoff control, and real
  native operators remain the foundational route. The release does not promote
  a readout-domain equivalence or floating-point certificate to an
  unconditional confinement theorem.
keywords:
